area: sanitize
case: 09-lone-continuation
verification: explicit-divergence
oracle: python
projection: sanitize
reason: the oracle projection must read the corpus through a text decode (its sanitizer takes str), so the ill-formed byte arrives as U+FFFD before it is called; the port's sanitizer is byte-faithful and passes the lone continuation byte through. The escape pass itself agrees: same count, same reversibility, same idempotence.
